<section class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.12"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Services</nav><span class="kicker light fade-up">What we do</span><h1 class="fade-up" style="animation-delay:.06s">Insurance Appraisal Services Across New Mexico</h1><p class="lede fade-up" style="animation-delay:.14s">From a one-time estimate review to full appraisal-panel representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of the loss.</p><div class="btn-row fade-up" style="animation-delay:.22s;margin-top:26px"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn light" href="/contact-new-mexico-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="card-grid" data-stagger><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">01</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We serve as the appraiser you name when your policy’s appraisal clause is invoked on a disputed claim.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/stucco-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/stucco-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/stucco-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">02</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Home Insurance Appraisal</h2><p>Independent valuation for disputed homeowners claims on stucco, adobe, frame and manufactured homes.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial-center.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-center-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial-center.webp 811w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="811" height="541" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">03</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for commercial buildings, apartment complexes and HOA or condo associations across New Mexico.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/hail-roof-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-stones.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-stones-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-stones.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">04</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Hail &amp; Roof Appraisal</h2><p>Hail claims on shingle and tile roofs, swamp coolers, skylights and stucco, valued independently.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/high-wind-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/dust-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/dust-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/dust-storm.webp 946w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="946" height="631" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">05</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>High Wind Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Valuation for spring wind, monsoon microburst and eastern-plains tornado damage to homes and buildings.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">06</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Plumbing leaks and monsoon roof leaks through parapets and canales, valued room by room.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">07</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Independent valuation for house fires, structure fires and smoke or soot damage throughout a building.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/wildfire-loss-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke.webp 1080w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1080" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">08</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Wildfire Loss Appraisal</h2><p>Total and partial wildfire losses: rebuild cost, smoke and ash, contents, debris removal and living expense.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/flat-roof-stucco-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flat-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flat-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flat-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">09</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Flat Roof &amp; Stucco Appraisal</h2><p>Pueblo Revival and Territorial flat roofs, parapets, canales and stucco matching, valued by specialists.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/winter-freeze-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">10</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Winter Freeze Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Burst pipes, ice dams and cold-snap losses in northern and high-elevation New Mexico homes and cabins.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/claim-estimate-review/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 957w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="957" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">11</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Claim Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line look at the carrier’s estimate to find missing scope, pricing gaps and depreciation errors.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraiser-services/umpire-services/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, (max-width:1060px) 50vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">12</span></span><span class="pb"><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for appraisal panels, with full disclosure of any prior relationships.</p><span class="more">Learn more</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-white"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv-l"><span class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</span><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that, and some disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn" href="/appraiser-services/claim-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="rv-r"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one step only?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and HOA claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: retail, office, warehouse, multifamily, churches, schools and HOA master policies.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is every peril covered by appraisal?</summary><div class="a"><p>Appraisal can value any covered loss when the only disagreement is the amount. Whether something is covered is a separate question.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div class="in rv"><div><h2>Is the carrier’s number short?</h2><p>Send the estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you plainly what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/contact-new-mexico-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></div></section>
